      "when": "[Either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase).",
      "target": "A **HERETIC ASTARTES INFANTRY** unit of yours that has not yet been **selected to fight** in the phase.",
      "effect": "Melee attacks by the unit's models against **CHARACTER** units can re-roll their [Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls), for the rest of the phase. After the unit has fought, if those attacks **destroyed** any enemy **CHARACTER** models, pick an enemy unit up to 6\" from the unit: it has to make a [Battle-shock test](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock); but if those attacks destroyed the enemy **WARLORD**, each enemy unit up to 6\" from the unit has to make one instead."
